   174	Return Value
   175	Returns a number that expresses the ratio of the two compared values:
   176	
   177	if the result is less than zero, x is less than y (x<y)
   178	if the result is equal to zero, x is equal to y (x=y)
   179	if the result is greater than zero, x is greater than y (x>y)
